User *-- UserProfile : has
User *-- FitnessGoal : sets
User *-- TrainingPreference : specifies
User -- FitnessProgram : participates in

FitnessGoal --> FitnessProgram : drives
TrainingPreference --> FitnessProgram : shapes

FitnessProgram *-- MacroPlan : contains
FitnessProgram *-- TrainingPlan : contains
FitnessProgram *-- WeeklyWeighIn : tracks

TrainingPlan *-- TrainingWeek : consists of
TrainingWeek *-- TrainingDay : contains

TrainingDay *-- ProgramExercise : has
ProgramExercise --> Exercise : refers to

ExerciseCatalog ..> Exercise : fetches <<API>>
UserProfile ..> ExerciseCatalog : filters by experience and injuries

WeeklyWeighIn --> WeightProgress : calculates
WeightProgress ..> MacroAdjustment : if deviation
MacroAdjustment --> MacroPlan : updates

UserInputHandler ..> User : creates
UserInputHandler ..> UserProfile : populates
UserInputHandler ..> FitnessGoal : collects
UserInputHandler ..> TrainingPreference : collects
UserInputHandler ..> WeeklyWeighIn : records

'DatabaseRepository ..> User : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> UserProfile : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> FitnessProgram : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> MacroPlan : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> TrainingPlan : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> WeeklyWeighIn : persists
'DatabaseRepository ..> WeightProgress : persists

@enduml